  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Technical Services for project reviews, monitoring and evaluations and technical advisory support to ensure BRAC SPA strongly focuses on achieving results in reducing poverty in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Provision of Technical Services for project reviews, monitoring and evaluations and technical advisory support to ensure BRAC SPA strongly focuses on achieving results in reducing poverty in Bangladesh is a component of Strategic Partnership between BRAC, DFID and AusAID to support BRAC in delivering progress towards the MDGs in Bangladesh and to support its Institutional Development reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;234,558. It works in the following sector(s): Rural development, Primary education, Reproductive health care, Water supply and sanitation - large systems.</narrative>
  </description>
